Package: spatioTemporalIndices
Type: Package
Title: Spatio-Temporal Index Model (STIM)
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: c(person(c("Olav","Nikolai"), "Breivik",role=c("aut","cre"), email="olavbr@nr.no"),
	    person("Fredrik","Aanes",role="aut"),
            person("Fabian", "Zimmermann", role="aut", email="fabian.zimmermann@hi.no"))
Author: Olav Nikolai Breivik [aut, cre],
	Fredik Aanes [aut],
	Fabian Zimmermann [aut]
Maintainer: Olav Nikolai Breivik <olavbr@nr.no>,
	Fabian Zimmermann <fabian.zimmermann@hi.no>
Description: A spatio-temporal model for estimating abundance indices, both at length and at age. Indices are constructed by length using a spatio-temporal model. If aging data is provided, catch per unit effort by length is converted to catch per unit effort by age using an internally estimated spatio-temporal age-length key.
URL: https://github.com/NorskRegnesentral/spatioTemporalIndices
